          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "being displayed here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 8.49,
          "en": "it's time to make sure that once we select an answer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.49,
          "end": 11.61,
          "en": "we move on to the next answer in line.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.61,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "And to do that, we must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
