          "en": "that this question index here changes over time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 20.55,
          "en": "because this question index here determines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 23.85,
          "en": "which question is our current question,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.85,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "which then determines which question text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 29.853,
          "en": "and which question answers are shown on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.26,
          "end": 33.78,
          "en": "So how can we change this index?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.78,
          "end": 36.57,
          "en": "Well by managing it as state again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.57,
          "end": 39.075,
          "en": "and that's why I created questions screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.075,
          "end": 41.1,
          "en": "as a stateful widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.1,
          "end": 44.403,
          "en": "so that we can manage and change state in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 48.93,
          "en": "We should now add a new variable here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.93,
          "end": 52.17,
          "en": "in this questions screen state class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.17,
          "end": 55.95,
          "en": "And that could be the current question index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.95,
          "end": 57.06,
          "en": "The name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.06,
          "end": 60.3,
          "en": "but of course it should describe which kind of value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.3,
          "end": 62.49,
          "en": "will be stored inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.49,
          "end": 66.3,
          "en": "Now initially this should probably be set to zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.3,
          "end": 67.8,
          "en": "so that we start with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.8,
          "end": 71.49,
          "en": "the first question in our list of questions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.49,
          "end": 72.9,
          "en": "but it should then change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.9,
          "end": 75.72,
          "en": "whenever we click one of these answer buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.72,
          "end": 77.85,
          "en": "Therefore, we also must add a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.85,
          "end": 81.21000000000001,
          "en": "to this questions screen state class here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.21000000000001,
          "end": 84.87,
          "en": "and that method could be called answer question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.87,
          "end": 87.09,
          "en": "because that is what we're in the end doing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.09,
          "end": 89.43,
          "en": "when we click one of these answer buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.43,
          "end": 91.86,
          "en": "we answer the question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.86,
          "end": 93.3,
          "en": "And as a result of doing that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.3,
          "end": 95.49000000000001,
          "en": "we wanna move on to the next question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 95.49000000000001,
          "end": 97.47,
          "en": "But of course later we also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.47,
          "end": 99.87299999999999,
          "en": "that we store the answer that was picked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.67,
          "end": 104.64,
          "en": "So therefore here we have the answer question function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.64,
          "end": 107.19,
          "en": "which doesn't return anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.19,
          "end": 108.27000000000001,
          "en": "And in there I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.27000000000001,
          "end": 111.213,
          "en": "to increase current question index by one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 115.89,
          "en": "Now this can be done by setting current question index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.89,
          "end": 120.48,
          "en": "equal to current question index plus one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.48,
          "end": 122.49,
          "en": "This might look strange at first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.49,
          "end": 124.71,
          "en": "but you can access the variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.71,
          "end": 127.5,
          "en": "which you then set on the left side of the equal sign,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.5,
          "end": 129.81,
          "en": "also on the right side of the equal sign",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.81,
          "end": 133.59,
          "en": "to derive the new value to which it should be set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.59,
          "end": 137.19,
          "en": "because that right side will actually be executed first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.19,
          "end": 139.59,
          "en": "So here, when this line of code executes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.59,
          "end": 143.16,
          "en": "Dart will first take a look at current question index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.16,
          "end": 145.47,
          "en": "here on the right side of the equal sign",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.47,
          "end": 148.41,
          "en": "and take the value that's currently stored in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.41,
          "end": 150.6,
          "en": "Initially that will be zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.6,
          "end": 153.51,
          "en": "It'll then add one to it so that overall",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.51,
          "end": 156.27,
          "en": "for the first time this function is executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 156.27,
          "end": 158.64,
          "en": "we would have a value of one here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 158.64,
          "end": 163.64,
          "en": "And then this new value is stored back into this variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.68,
          "end": 166.74,
          "en": "So that is how we can increment this variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.74,
          "end": 170.46,
          "en": "And since this is something you will find yourself doing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.46,
          "end": 172.17000000000002,
          "en": "quite often in code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.17000000000002,
          "end": 175.02,
          "en": "Dart actually also gives you a shortcut for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.02,
          "end": 178.23,
          "en": "Instead of writing it like this, which you can do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.23,
          "end": 180.12,
          "en": "but which is a bit long,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.12,
          "end": 185.12,
          "en": "you can also set current question index plus equal one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.16,
          "end": 188.97,
          "en": "This code is equal to this code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 191.52,
          "en": "By using this plus equal operator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 191.52,
          "end": 194.85,
          "en": "You are telling Dart that you wanna set this variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 194.85,
          "end": 198.51,
          "en": "equal to its current value plus one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 198.51,
          "end": 201.123,
          "en": "So this is simply a shortcut for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.02,
          "end": 204.75,
          "en": "And if you want to increment the value by one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.75,
          "end": 206.82,
          "en": "there's an even shorter syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.82,
          "end": 208.62,
          "en": "because you can then also just set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 208.62,
          "end": 211.71,
          "en": "current question index plus plus.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.71,
          "end": 216.71,
          "en": "This increments the value by one, and only by one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 217.14,
          "end": 219.72,
          "en": "So if you wanna add two to that value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 219.72,
          "end": 222.12,
          "en": "this syntax could not be used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.12,
          "end": 224.013,
          "en": "This syntax could be used though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 225,
          "end": 227.01,
          "en": "But if it's one that you want to add,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.01,
          "end": 230.463,
          "en": "you can use this syntax, this code for doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 231.51,
          "end": 235.5,
          "en": "And a similar syntax would also exist for deducting one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 235.5,
          "end": 240.333,
          "en": "by using minus minus, or here in this case, minus equals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 241.35,
          "end": 243.27,
          "en": "And that's not just a case in Dart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 243.27,
          "end": 245.7,
          "en": "Instead, you find these syntaxes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 245.7,
          "end": 248.343,
          "en": "in most programming languages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 249.42,
          "end": 252.66,
          "en": "So this will add one to the current question index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 252.66,
          "end": 255.39,
          "en": "And now we can use the current question index here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 255.39,
          "end": 258.96,
          "en": "instead of hard coding zero inside of the build method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 258.96,
          "end": 261.663,
          "en": "to access the question with that index here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 263.25,
          "end": 264.51,
          "en": "Now, of course, at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 264.51,
          "end": 267.18,
          "en": "the build method would never execute again though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 267.18,
          "end": 268.74,
          "en": "because as you learned before,",
