          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 278.46,
          "end": 279.87,
          "en": "So that's the correct way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 279.87,
          "end": 282.9,
          "en": "of updating current question index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 282.9,
          "end": 285.39,
          "en": "And with that, the next step is to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 285.39,
          "end": 289.83,
          "en": "that this answer question method here is actually executed",
