          "en": "which we just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 310.83,
          "end": 312.84,
          "en": "As you learned, without parentheses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 312.84,
          "end": 315.12,
          "en": "because we wanna point at that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 315.12,
          "end": 318.603,
          "en": "and pass the function as a value to onTap.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 320.58,
          "end": 323.25,
          "en": "And with this, if we now are saved this all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 323.25,
          "end": 327.33,
          "en": "we should be able to click this and move on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
